.socket.jitx
SKILLS_PLAN.md

# Eval run outputs. The receipts and raw judge output are bulky local forensics
# and carry candid commentary about the skills, which a shipped bundle should not
# distribute. What has to survive the machine is EVAL-LOG.md at the repo root:
# the scores as they stood at PR time, generated from these receipts by
# skillify's `receipt.py log`. Without it the no-regression baseline lives on one
# laptop and a fresh clone has nothing to compare against.
skills/*/evals/receipts/
.DS_Store
__pycache__/
.venv/
.jitx/
